redirected silently to the lobby, a failed message fetch looked identical
to an empty channel, and unknown URLs rendered nothing (M2, UX#9-11).

- ErrorBoundary component wrapped around App in main.tsx; fallback UI with
  reload.
- ChannelView: fetch errors show a Couldn't load this channel screen with
  Retry (refetch) and Back to Lobby instead of a silent redirect.
- MessageList: error prop distinguishes Couldn't load messages from the
